<title>UK: LME suspends deliveries into Strasbourg.</title>
<headline>LME suspends deliveries into Strasbourg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME), in a notice to all members, said that due to problems with local customs regulations, deliveries of LME warrantable metal into Strasbourg have been suspended until further notice.</p>
<p>Currently Strasbourg warehouses are only listed for storage of aluminium alloy and as at the week ended Jan 3 LME stock data showed a nil return.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
